<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0829_T20MOMS_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! A visitor. You must be one of the\nnew trainers everyone’s talking about.\fMy son Gold set off on his own journey\nnot long ago. The house feels so big\fand quiet now that he’s out on the road.\rIf your travels ever cross his, tell him\nhis mother is proud of him--and that he\fstill hasn’t called nearly enough!</language>
	</row>
</body>
